docs {
  # Data-Stats-Member_Recap

  ## Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Notes |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------|
  | cust_id | number | no | Defaults to the authenticated member. |
  | season | number | no | Season (quarter) within the year; if not supplied the recap will be fore the entire year. |
  | year | number | no | Season year; if not supplied the current calendar year (UTC) is used. |
}
